       <span className=\"absolute top-4 right-4 bg-black text-white rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold\">Promo available</span>\n          <img className=\"w-3/4 max-w-[300px] object-contain mt-4 transform transition-transform duration-300 group-hover105\"\n               src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/420x560.png?text=Jersey\"\n               alt=\"The Best Part Basketball Jersey\"\n               loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <div className=\"mt-auto text-center\">\n            <div className=\"mt-6 font-semibold text-sm\">The Best Part Basketball Jersey</div>\n            <div className=\"text-sm mt-2\">$32.00</div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n    \n        \n        <article className=\"relative bg-[#D6E1E5] rounded-2xl p-10 min-h-[480px] flex flex-col items-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover2 hover group\">\n          <span className=\"absolute top-4 right-4 bg-black text-white rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold\">Promo available</span>\n          <img className=\"w-3/4 max-w-[300px] object-contain mt-4 transform transition-transform duration-300 group-hover105\"\n               src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/420x560.png?text=Leggings\"\n               alt=\"Brainy Brain Capri Leggings\"\n               loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <div className=\"mt-auto text-center\">\n            <div className=\"mt-6 font-semibold text-sm\">Brainy Brain Capri Leggings</div>\n            <div className=\"text-sm mt-2\">$42.00</div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n    \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
