     loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"mt-auto text-center\">\n        <div class=\"mt-6 font-semibold text-sm\">The Best Part Basketball Jersey</div>\n        <div class=\"text-sm mt-2\">$32.00</div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- Product Card -->\n    <article class=\"relative bg-[#D6E1E5] rounded-2xl p-10 min-h-[480px] flex flex-col items-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl group\">\n      <span class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 bg-black text-white rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold\">Promo available</span>\n      <img class=\"w-3/4 max-w-[300px] object-contain mt-4 transform transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\"\n           src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/420x560.png?text=Leggings\"\n           alt=\"Brainy Brain Capri Leggings\"\n           loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"mt-auto text-center\">\n        <div class=\"mt-6 font-semibold text-sm\">Brainy Brain Capri Leggings</div>\n        <div class=\"text-sm mt-2\">$42.00</div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
